{"scene_id": "s00663", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00663.fountain", "heading": "INT. GENERATION SHIP - SEED VAULT - CYCLE 4,112", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ENGINEER NAKIA OKORO-VEGA", "names": ["ENGINEER NAKIA OKORO-VEGA", "NAKIA"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "ARCHIVIST EZRA HADDAD", "names": ["ARCHIVIST EZRA HADDAD", "EZRA"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 7}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. GENERATION SHIP - SEED VAULT - CYCLE 4,112", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A circular chamber lined with frost-white drawers, each etched with a Latin name.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Cold air hisses from vents.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A single catwalk crosses the center, lit by thin blue strips.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "ENGINEER NAKIA OKORO-VEGA, fifties, climbs the ladder to the catwalk, a tool belt clanking at her hip.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, in a nest of cables, sits ARCHIVIST EZRA HADDAD, seventies, with a data slate propped on his knees.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "She reaches the top and looks down at him.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "He doesn't look up.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Temperature's drifting.", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Drawer forty-one is already warm.", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "She descends.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "He closes the slate.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "She kneels beside him and puts a hand on his shoulder, and he leans into it, barely.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How many are gone?", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eleven thousand. Roughly.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of how many?", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "All of them, if she isn't fixed in a week.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She stands.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She crosses to the nearest drawer, wipes frost from the label with her sleeve, and slides it open.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside, tiny glass vials gleam in their rows, many clouded.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We can save the grains.", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The grains aren't the loss.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No?", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the orchids. The lilacs. The ones nobody needs.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "She closes the drawer.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "She doesn't argue.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll start with the orchids.", "name": "NAKIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "EZRA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "She climbs back to the catwalk, reaches into the ceiling panel, and begins to work.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, he opens the slate and begins to read aloud the names of the dying, one by one.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}